      "Language": "rus",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The integral \"profile\" of the groups of inpatients suffering from somatogenic chronic painful syndromes was plotted on a material of a comprehensive study into central and peripheral hormones, the total content, and correlations. Enkephalins are shown to play the integrating part in the development of stress-algogenic reactions."},
